 "text": "Hello, how are things going? I usually write them a full week in advance to give people time to hear about it. What feels right for you? Then short weeks work best. Saturday to Saturday is easy to understand. Email is fine, as long as you check your inbox and spam folder every day. A lot of providers do email only now. Then ask her to. She'll be proud to have her hand print it every week. Stick a little note in her mailbox every Monday. A simple week by week calendar is enough. You can draw little pictures next to the days if you like. People love them.",
